#20900
The Mountain Path~
   A path climbs from the barrow-lands into the mountains, cut into the rock
by dwarven hands long ago. The peaks above are split and jagged, as if
something vast struck them from the sky. Cold wind howls down the path,
carrying the distant ring of hammers from deep inside the stone.
