#20902
The Wyvern Ledges~
   A narrow ledge climbs the face of the split mountain toward a line of
caves. The rock is white with droppings and littered with bones: goats,
dwarves, a horse. Wyverns perch on every outcrop, grey-scaled and barb-
tailed, and they have seen you.
