#20904
The Bridge over the Abyss~
   A stone bridge with no rail spans a chasm so deep that its bottom is lost
in darkness. Hot air rises from below, smelling of sulphur. Halfway across,
the bridge is cracked through, and the crack widens a little every time
someone crosses.
