The Gate of Durhold~
   A gate of black iron fifty feet high is set into the mountain's face,
carved with kings and anvils. One leaf hangs broken. The dwarves who guarded
it stand in their places still, grey-skinned, grey-bearded, their eyes
black, and they raise their axes as you approach.
