The Great Hall of Durhold~
   A hall carved from the living rock, so vast its roof is lost in darkness.
Great pillars carved as dwarven kings hold up the mountain. The tables where
a thousand dwarves feasted are overturned and covered with grey dust. The
ring of hammers is very loud here.
