#20911
The Living Vein~
   At the bottom of the shaft, a vein of grey ore as wide as a river runs
through the rock, and it is alive: it moves, slowly, like a muscle, and it
whispers. The dwarves mined it to make their iron. The iron carries its
whisper into everyone who wears it.
